00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:38.940
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: However, Attorney Lindon, I presume, again, for the understanding of the senator judges and the public as well, may aligasyon yung prosecution noon na itong lupang ito covered by TCT ending in 3134 ay hindi dineklara sa SALN na yung kalawang pangulo. Nais mong patunayan sa pamamagitan ng testigong ito na ito'y dineklara sa kanyang SALN. Would that be correct?

