Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: And kindly help us out to remove it from the realm of possibilities to the actual realm of actuality na ito yung ito ngayon. Kindly help us see that counsel through this witness. If indeed that is what this witness will be testifying on.

00:22:13.110 --> 00:22:13.810
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Understood, Your Honor.

00:22:14.050 --> 00:22:14.370
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You

00:22:14.370 --> 00:22:14.890
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: may proceed, Sir.

