Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Thank you, Your Honor. Good morning, Sir.

00:22:18.560 --> 00:22:18.780
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: Good

00:22:18.780 --> 00:22:19.220
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: morning, Sir.

00:22:19.400 --> 00:22:21.140
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Please state your name for the record, Sir.

00:22:22.280 --> 00:22:26.060
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: I am Engineer John Kenneth Daguhoy Enumerables.

00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:27.980
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: What is your profession, Sir?

00:22:28.960 --> 00:22:32.620
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: I am a licensed civil engineer. And

00:22:32.620 --> 00:22:33.040
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: also,

00:22:33.860 --> 00:22:38.020
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: I am a registered, a licensed real estate appraiser.

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:42.120
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: How long have you been a engineer, sir?

00:22:42.870 --> 00:22:47.450
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: I passed the board exam in the year 2000.

00:22:48.910 --> 00:22:52.050
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: And how long have you been a real estate appraiser, sir?

00:22:52.990 --> 00:22:58.010
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: I passed the board exam for the real estate appraiser in the year 2011.

00:22:58.970 --> 00:23:04.690
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: What are your duties and responsibilities as the City Assessor of the Island Garden City of Samal?

00:23:05.370 --> 00:23:23.440
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: The City Assessor is responsible for the classification, assessment, appraisal, valuation of all real property within the territorial jurisdiction of the City for taxation purposes.

00:23:24.120 --> 00:23:34.700
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: In relation to the To your duties and responsibilities, what records are maintained by the city assessor in his office, sir?

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:53.780
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: First is the tax declarations, the tax maps, the tax mapping control roll or TMCR, the field appraisal and assessment sheet or FAAS, and other assessment records, sir.

00:23:56.550 --> 00:24:17.390
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Yesterday, the Engineer Adalin already testified about tax maps. But in relation to the City Assessor's Office of Island Garden City of Samal, you mentioned tax maps. What are tax maps?

00:24:18.090 --> 00:24:32.750
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: Tax maps is a document used to identify and locate all real property. within the territorial jurisdiction of the city for the real property taxation.

00:24:33.720 --> 00:24:53.020
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: Your Honor, excuse me. I'm sorry. Just to move things along, we're willing to stipulate that the same descriptions given by the witness yesterday regarding the same documents that both of them will be testifying on. We're willing to stipulate on that so that we don't have to go through this tedious exercise.

00:24:53.300 --> 00:24:58.320
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: The authenticity as well as the due execution of the documents he will present?

00:24:58.960 --> 00:25:05.700
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: We'll also be willing to stipulate upon seeing them, because we have not yet seen them. We'll just examine them closely.

00:25:05.980 --> 00:25:07.160
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Haven't you been given a copy?

00:25:07.660 --> 00:25:08.540
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: Not yet, Your Honor.

00:25:09.800 --> 00:25:11.100
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Have we given a copy?

00:25:18.600 --> 00:25:22.360
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Kindly give a copy of the documents submitted to the clerk.

00:25:23.280 --> 00:25:33.220
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: Thank you, Your Honor. And I think right now, the defense has the point of explaining what are these documents, what are their purposes. We're just

00:25:33.220 --> 00:25:34.100
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: stipulating, Your Honor,

00:25:34.200 --> 00:25:39.760
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: to move things along that the description given yesterday, we're willing to adopt. The

00:25:39.760 --> 00:25:52.140
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: stipulation is duly noted. Kindly take note as well, Attorney Lindon, so that you don't have to go through the longer route of proving the authenticity of the documents.

00:25:54.090 --> 00:25:54.690
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You

00:25:54.690 --> 00:25:55.250
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: may proceed, sir.

00:25:55.790 --> 00:26:14.270
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Your Honor, may we just clarify if we will dispense with questions regarding the nature of tax maps, tax declarations, their manner of creation, and the proper custodian of these documents.

00:26:14.830 --> 00:26:16.150
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: I presume

00:26:16.150 --> 00:26:23.570
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: that's what the intention of Atty. Tolosa is. He admits and stipulates to that already in relation to this witness.

00:26:25.060 --> 00:26:25.920
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: Confirmed, Your Honor.

00:26:26.100 --> 00:26:46.160
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Yes, Your Honor. But we would have to still lay the basis for the nature of these documents, Your Honor. Because even though these are the same kind of documents as that which was identified and authenticated by... City Assessor Office of

00:26:46.160 --> 00:26:46.700
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Davao City.

00:26:46.740 --> 00:27:07.780
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: I understand what you're saying, counsel. Yes, you can explain because each city, each local government unit has its own way of coming up with its tax map and or system of zoning. So you can proceed to lay the basis in that regard. However, in regard to the documents you will present, you can dispense with the authenticity and execution of the same, including identification of the same.

00:27:08.160 --> 00:27:08.560
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Thank

00:27:08.560 --> 00:27:09.180
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: you, Your Honor. You may

00:27:09.180 --> 00:27:09.600
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: proceed, sir.

00:27:10.920 --> 00:27:16.470
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: You earlier mentioned about tax map, sir. How are tax maps created, sir?

00:27:17.420 --> 00:27:39.720
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: It's created to, first, the gathering of the data, just like the cadastral maps, the approved subdivision plan, and even the title. Then second, we conducted surveys and ocular inspections and verifications.

00:27:41.000 --> 00:27:49.060
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: Then third is the identifications of the lot number and plotting of the parcels on the map.

00:27:49.950 --> 00:27:54.810
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: You mentioned about data, sir. Where do you get the data you required for...

00:27:54.810 --> 00:27:56.210
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: Data is coming...

00:27:56.210 --> 00:27:56.670
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: Sorry, sir.

00:27:56.690 --> 00:27:57.510
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Let me finish, sir.

00:27:57.670 --> 00:28:02.430
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Sorry. Where do you get the data in relation to the creation of a tax map, sir?

00:28:02.770 --> 00:28:11.150
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: The data is coming from the DENR, the cadastral maps, and also the approved subdivision plan is from the DENR.

00:28:11.590 --> 00:28:20.850
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: And, sino naman po yung gumagawa ng tax maps sa City Assessor's Office ng Island Garden City of Samal, Sir?

00:28:21.250 --> 00:28:27.660
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: The preparation of the tax map is in our tax mapping division.

00:28:28.200 --> 00:28:29.360
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Tax mapping division.

00:28:31.100 --> 00:28:35.220
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Yung purpose ng tax map, Sir? Ano po yung purpose niya, Sir?

00:28:36.240 --> 00:28:44.960
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: Ang purpose po yung tax map is to Identify and locate the properties within the city.

00:28:45.160 --> 00:28:53.940
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: And how do you ensure, sir, that the tax mapping records of the city assessor's office of Island Garden City of Samal are accurate, sir?

00:28:54.700 --> 00:29:01.500
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: Because we base on the approved subdivision plan and the technical description in the title.

00:29:03.610 --> 00:29:16.790
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: You also mentioned, sir, about that the city assessor's office Also keeps tax declarations. Ano po ba yung tax declarations in relation sa opisina ng Samal assessor's office, sir?

00:29:17.430 --> 00:29:28.270
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: The tax declaration, it is a document used to identify and determine the taxable assessed value of the property for taxation purposes.

00:29:28.830 --> 00:29:32.090
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Ano po bang taxes ang may kinalaman sa tax declaration?

00:29:33.120 --> 00:29:35.360
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: Yung real property tax, sir.

00:29:36.060 --> 00:29:42.080
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Sa... Sa Samal sir, sino ba yung mga kailangan magbayad ng real property tax?

00:29:43.130 --> 00:29:47.170
Engr. John Kenneth D. Enumerables: The property owner or his or her representative.

00:29:47.840 --> 00:29:52.300
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: And sa Samal po, paano po binabayaran sa inyo yung real property tax?

00:29:52.920 --> 00:30:04.680
