01:59:19.820 --> 01:59:22.080
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Yes, Atty. Sheila.

01:59:24.550 --> 01:59:26.970
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Again, you can pause for lunch, attorney.

01:59:27.130 --> 01:59:27.550
Atty. Sheila C. Sison: Yes, just

01:59:27.550 --> 01:59:30.570
Atty. Sheila C. Sison: last point, Mr. Presiding Officer.

01:59:30.830 --> 01:59:31.530
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Please, ma'am.

01:59:31.570 --> 01:59:31.810
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: Your

01:59:31.810 --> 01:59:44.570
