01:59:44.570 --> 01:59:45.750
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: objecting if the

01:59:45.750 --> 01:59:48.690
Atty. Benjamin Tolosa Jr.: court... Your Honor, may I please be allowed to finish?

01:59:49.220 --> 01:59:50.120
Atty. Sheila C. Sison: No, but I'm just addressing...

