03:29:32.090 --> 03:29:33.290
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po. Kasi na-process na...

03:29:33.290 --> 03:29:35.230
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi alam niya na bawal. Kaya niya kinurik.

03:29:36.850 --> 03:29:38.010
Vingeline A. Bahan: Wala. Kasi

03:29:38.010 --> 03:29:44.410
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: alam niya na bawal na hindi pwedeng tumanggap na double compensation ang BP. Kaya ginawa niya, kinurik niya, ginawa niya 2021.

03:29:44.410 --> 03:29:48.440
Vingeline A. Bahan: Ang preparation po ng voucher is matagal na po. Your Honor.

03:29:49.180 --> 03:29:53.360
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Kaya nga, pero yung pagbabago, it was done after the fact.

03:29:54.100 --> 03:29:54.740
Vingeline A. Bahan: Hindi

03:29:54.740 --> 03:29:57.500
Vingeline A. Bahan: po, during po sa preparation ng voucher.

03:29:57.520 --> 03:29:58.140
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Ang 2021?

03:30:00.000 --> 03:30:06.000
Vingeline A. Bahan: 2022. Upon checking po kasi sa City Accountant's Office kami naman po ang mag-evaluate ng vouchers.

03:30:06.140 --> 03:30:13.580
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Kaya nga po dito 2022 nga po na-release yung voucher diba? 2022 BP na si BP Sara. Tama?

03:30:13.780 --> 03:30:18.260
Vingeline A. Bahan: Dated po ito December 30 na 2022.

03:30:19.780 --> 03:30:22.700
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: So she's already the Vice President at that time. Tama.

03:30:24.090 --> 03:30:34.170
Vingeline A. Bahan: Processing po. Ang pag-process nila po sa city mayors kasi po sila ang nag-process. Tapos dumating po sa amin for payable kasi ito December 30, 2022 po.

03:30:34.490 --> 03:30:50.150
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: O sana hindi niyo muna in-relation ang point ko. So hinintayin niyo na lang kasi alam niyo naman BP na siya. Hindi siya pwedeng tumanggap ng pangalawang sweldo or another sweldo outside of being BP. Hinintayin niyo na lang after na maging BP siya sa 2028. So wala na problema. So parang lumilito ito ha.

03:30:52.100 --> 03:31:07.360
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Para lumilitaw na gumawa kayo ng alteration, gumawa kayo ng pagbabago dahil alam nyo bawal kaya kinoss out nyo yung original entry tapos sa ilalim nun naglagay ka ng dalawang entry and then naglagay lang kayo ng countersign. I was just waiting for him to ask those questions which he did not. Kaya nga ako tumayo rito ngayon.

03:31:08.420 --> 03:31:09.600
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer.

03:31:09.600 --> 03:31:10.780
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you, Your Honor.

03:31:10.900 --> 03:31:20.560
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: I think the direct examination is not yet finished, Senator Judge Raffy. We don't know yet how Attorney Lindon will wind up. Number two,

03:31:22.140 --> 03:31:41.080
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: The payment was made, for the record, in 2023. The reimbursement voucher was prepared in 2022 for a supposed salary differential given the salary increase of the position of mayor in 2020 and 2021. Is that correct, Atty. Lindon?

03:31:41.280 --> 03:32:02.080
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Yes, Your Honor. And just to clarify, Your Honor, just to... For the record, the defense is not yet done with the direct examination. We just completed with the identification and marking of the documents, Your Honor. And we were about to ask the same questions, Your Honor.

03:32:02.340 --> 03:32:02.580
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Okay.

03:32:03.500 --> 03:32:12.430
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: We'll allow it. The comments of Senator Judge Raffi are duly noted. Attorney Lindon, you may proceed.

03:32:12.810 --> 03:32:13.330
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Thank

03:32:13.330 --> 03:32:25.620
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: you, Your Honor. Yung nabanggit niyo pong amount na 64,194 pesos and 72 centavos, kailan po ito na-release?

03:32:26.510 --> 03:32:35.390
Vingeline A. Bahan: January ito po sa cheque po, na-issue po ang cheque nito is January 10, 2023 po.

03:32:37.050 --> 03:32:41.370
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Bakit po nung 2023 lang ito na-release?

03:32:41.940 --> 03:32:53.080
Vingeline A. Bahan: Na-complete po ang supporting documents on that year po, 2023. Kasi hindi naman kami makarelease kung hindi po complete po yung mga supporting documents.

03:32:53.740 --> 03:32:59.380
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Bakit po noong 2023 nyo lang na-complete po yung mga supporting documents?

03:32:59.740 --> 03:33:03.800
Vingeline A. Bahan: Na-comply na po lahat ng supporting documents in the year 2023 po.

03:33:04.020 --> 03:33:06.820
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Ano po bang mga supporting documents yung i-comply nyo dapat?

03:33:07.400 --> 03:33:10.920
Vingeline A. Bahan: Marami po siya. Isa po nito, itong mga ito po.

03:33:11.590 --> 03:33:13.030
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Ano po? Sige po. Pakisabi po.

03:33:13.430 --> 03:33:18.790
Vingeline A. Bahan: NOSA po. Itong naka-attach po dito. Yung mga payroll register at NOSA po.

03:33:19.560 --> 03:33:20.040
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Okay.

03:33:20.360 --> 03:33:26.840
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Yung 64,194 pesos and 72 centavos, ma'am. Saan galing ito?

03:33:27.480 --> 03:33:29.480
Vingeline A. Bahan: Sa salary differentials po.

03:33:29.640 --> 03:33:32.810
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Ano na nga po yung salary differential, ma'am? Salary

03:33:32.810 --> 03:33:33.530
Vingeline A. Bahan: Differentials,

03:33:33.530 --> 03:33:42.110
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Ma'am.

03:33:42.110 --> 03:33:48.910
Vingeline A. Bahan: May salary standardization law po tayo noong 2019 na may yearly tranches po na increase.

03:33:49.960 --> 03:33:57.580
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Anong public official, anong position po na public official ang may kinalaman sa salary increase? Anong...

03:33:57.580 --> 03:33:58.080
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yung

03:33:58.080 --> 03:34:01.860
Vingeline A. Bahan: salary standardization law of 2019 po.

03:34:02.000 --> 03:34:04.620
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Ano pong official yung mga covered dun sa increase na yun?

03:34:04.900 --> 03:34:08.060
Vingeline A. Bahan: Lahat po ng empleyado ng government po.

03:34:09.320 --> 03:34:11.240
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Kasama po ba dun ng mayor?

03:34:11.800 --> 03:34:12.360
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: We'll

03:34:12.360 --> 03:34:14.440
Vingeline A. Bahan: allow

03:34:14.440 --> 03:34:15.780
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: it for brevity, counsel.

03:34:16.420 --> 03:34:17.440
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Thank you, Your Honor.

03:34:19.260 --> 03:34:27.220
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: In relation po dito sa salary differential na sinabi nyo, may sinabit pa rin po ba kayo sa BIR? Kung meron man?

03:34:27.460 --> 03:34:39.020
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Leading your honor, I've been very lenient your honor, but it appears that every time the good counsel could not elicit the proper answer by asking the proper question, he would resort to asking leading questions.

03:34:39.560 --> 03:35:10.290
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Well, I checked the TSN too, Atty. Mae, and the basis of why they need to Call this witness and explain the amount received by the respondent is because of the testimony of the BIR. In fact, I was hoping he would be dealing with that issue earlier but I'll allow it at this point so that we can address the issue squarely in regard to the allegation raised by the prosecution. Again, for the information of the senator judges.

03:35:12.510 --> 03:35:26.910
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: During the presentation of the BIR witness, a form was presented showing that the Vice President received an amount of money from the city of Davao, corresponding to the amount being discussed now.

03:35:28.970 --> 03:35:40.530
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: So, yes, we will in the meantime overrule it, Atty. May, and allow the witness to answer. Kindly respond, ma'am, did you submit any document to the BIR in regard to this payment made to the Vice President?

03:35:41.020 --> 03:35:46.440
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po. As attachment po sa compensation paid ng city government po.

03:35:47.490 --> 03:35:50.010
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Is this required by law for you to submit?

03:35:50.390 --> 03:35:51.290
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po.

03:35:52.080 --> 03:36:00.220
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Ngayon itong salary differential, sweldo ba ito? Compensation ba ito kay VP Sara para sa anong period?

03:36:00.740 --> 03:36:03.780
Vingeline A. Bahan: 2020 and 21 year honor po.

03:36:03.980 --> 03:36:04.360
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Para

03:36:04.360 --> 03:36:05.060
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: sa anong pwesto?

03:36:05.060 --> 03:36:06.460
Vingeline A. Bahan: As city mayor po siya.

03:36:06.900 --> 03:36:15.380
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Dahil tumaas yung sweldo niya sa ngayon sa salary standardization law ng 2019, noong 2020 at 2021 habang City Mayor siya.

03:36:15.540 --> 03:36:17.000
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po, Your Honor.

03:36:17.320 --> 03:36:26.900
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Paano naman yung City Mayor siya mula 2020, January 2022 hanggang June 29, 2022?

03:36:28.140 --> 03:36:34.940
Vingeline A. Bahan: Bayad po, Your Honor. Nakaprepare po ang City Mayor's Office ng salary adjustment po.

03:36:35.510 --> 03:36:36.530
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: But wala dito.

03:36:39.160 --> 03:36:40.640
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Meron din ba kayong ginawang ganun?

03:36:40.820 --> 03:36:48.520
Vingeline A. Bahan: May monthly kasi during January pag payroll po. Tama na po yung na-prepare nila noong January 2022 po.

03:36:49.610 --> 03:36:58.110
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Hindi po. Ang tanong ko po, yung mga dokumentong nandito is para sa salary differential ni Vice President bilang Mayor ng 2020 at 2021.

03:36:58.630 --> 03:36:59.630
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes, Your Honor.

03:36:59.790 --> 03:37:09.770
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Asan po yung para sa salary differential niya ng January? To June 2022 bago siya naging vice president. Hindi po ba dapat meron din siya rin?

03:37:10.230 --> 03:37:15.970
Vingeline A. Bahan: Wala na po kasi tama na po ang na-prepare ng city mayors for that salary January 2021.

03:37:15.970 --> 03:37:21.850
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Ah, na-correct na yung salary niya para sa January. Hindi lang na-correct para sa 2020 and 2021.

03:37:22.890 --> 03:37:24.190
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Attorney Lindon, your witness.

03:37:24.470 --> 03:37:33.250
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: I'll just jump off from the question of the presiding officer. So, itong amount po na to, sinabi niyo na galing sa...

03:37:39.010 --> 03:37:46.590
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: So hindi po ito galing sa any service or practice of profession na ginawa niya habang siya ay vice president?

03:37:46.830 --> 03:37:47.710
Vingeline A. Bahan: Hindi po.

03:37:47.710 --> 03:37:49.500
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: The witness already answered, Your Honor.

03:37:49.840 --> 03:37:51.740
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: We then move to strike, Your Honor.

03:37:53.080 --> 03:38:03.020
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: For brevity, Attorney Mae, I'll allow it. But, Attorney Lindon, kindly be more conscious in regard to that. Although we are sui generis, still try to...

03:38:03.900 --> 03:38:14.280
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: And want to abbreviate the proceedings in regard to this witness because clearly we already get what you're trying to prove with this witness. But we'll allow it in the meantime. Please proceed, Attorney Lindon.

03:38:14.480 --> 03:38:16.260
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: That would be our last question, Your Honor.

03:38:17.930 --> 03:38:18.830
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Atty. May, cross.

03:38:19.330 --> 03:38:31.070
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Yes, Your Honor. May we be given maybe 10 minutes, Your Honor, just to organize our cross, Your Honor, because this is the first time that, first, we're seeing these documents, and second, that we are hearing this theory of the defense, Your Honor.

03:38:31.250 --> 03:38:35.710
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: We're giving you until 1.40, Atty. May, which is roughly 5 minutes.

03:38:36.050 --> 03:38:36.450
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Thank you.

03:38:36.450 --> 03:38:37.090
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Trial is in recess.

03:48:08.370 --> 03:48:09.570
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Any cross, Atty. May?

03:48:09.870 --> 03:48:15.930
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Yes, Your Honor. Quite lengthy, in fact, Your Honor. Good afternoon, Mr. Bahan.

03:48:16.780 --> 03:48:18.420
Vingeline A. Bahan: Good afternoon po, attorney.

03:48:21.990 --> 03:48:30.230
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Kanina nung tinatanong ka ng inyong posisyon, sinabi mo na ikaw ang city accountant ng Davao City.

03:48:30.430 --> 03:48:31.670
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po, attorney.

03:48:32.030 --> 03:48:32.270
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: At

03:48:32.270 --> 03:48:35.930
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: ikaw ay nagsimula bilang city accountant ng Davao City noong 2016.

03:48:39.020 --> 03:48:49.580
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: At kinukumpirma mo rin na ang unang nagtalaga sa iyo bilang city accountant ay ang respondent sa kasong ito na si Vice President Sara Duterte.

03:48:51.660 --> 03:48:52.660
Vingeline A. Bahan: Vice President

03:48:52.660 --> 03:48:54.440
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: as Mayor. As

03:48:54.440 --> 03:48:57.040
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Mayor. So siya rin ang nagtalaga sa iyo bilang City Accountant?

03:48:57.120 --> 03:49:02.020
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Yes po, sa term po niya. Pero matagal na po ako sa City Accountant's Office. Yes,

03:49:02.020 --> 03:49:09.560
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: but as City Accountant, ang Vice President ang nagtalaga sa inyo nung time na, nung panahon na siya pa ay Mayor ng City of Davao.

03:49:09.560 --> 03:49:13.300
Vingeline A. Bahan: Kasi po nag-retire na po yung City Accountant namin that time.

03:49:13.620 --> 03:49:24.490
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Yes, thank you for those information, Ms. Bahan. Just to remind you, moving forward, please just be responsive to the questions. Don't volunteer information that is not being asked of you.

03:49:24.730 --> 03:49:25.370
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po.

03:49:25.490 --> 03:49:26.110
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Salamat po.

03:49:27.970 --> 03:49:28.490
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Okay.

03:49:32.840 --> 03:49:45.260
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Papatutuhanan mo rin po na noong 2018, maliban sa pagiging city accountant, itinilaga rin kayo ng respondent bilang chairperson ng city audit and transition teams for barangay. Tama po ba?

03:49:47.080 --> 03:49:48.180
Vingeline A. Bahan: Ano po, attorney?

03:49:49.370 --> 03:50:01.170
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Tinalaga rin kayo nung 2018 bilang chairperson ng City Audit and Transition Teams for Barangay ng parehong tao na si Vice President Sara Duterte.

03:50:01.330 --> 03:50:01.810
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Your Honor, may

03:50:01.810 --> 03:50:03.470
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: we know the relevance of this question?

03:50:03.950 --> 03:50:05.910
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Your Honor, if

03:50:05.910 --> 03:50:10.930
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: she knows, if she knows counsel, we'll allow it. She's testing the credibility of the witness.

03:50:11.360 --> 03:50:16.900
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yung parang sa barangay election po, ako yung vice chair.

03:50:19.000 --> 03:50:25.000
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yung parang committee yan, yan po yung committee na yan, attorney. Maliban

03:50:25.000 --> 03:50:39.820
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: pa po doon sa pagtatalaga sa inyo na kabilang sa Investigating Committee ng Lungsod ng 2020, ikaw rin po ay itinalaga na chairperson ng City Audit and Transition Teams for Barangay.

03:50:39.880 --> 03:50:40.480
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes

03:50:40.480 --> 03:50:47.510
Vingeline A. Bahan: po, kasi may DILG circular po pero co-chair po ako, yung taga-BICAD po. Chairperson.

03:50:47.790 --> 03:50:48.010
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Aside

03:50:48.010 --> 03:50:56.690
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: from this, you were also designated as member of the investigating committee of the City of Davao in 2020. Tama po ba?

03:50:56.770 --> 03:50:58.410
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po. At

03:50:58.410 --> 03:51:04.650
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: ito po ay on top of your position as city accountant. Tama po ba?

03:51:04.650 --> 03:51:04.850
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po.

03:51:05.270 --> 03:51:16.060
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: At nagpatuloy rin po kayo sa paglilingkod. Sa pamahala ang lungsod, matapos bumaba si Vice President Sara Duterte bilang mayor. Tama po ba?

03:51:16.120 --> 03:51:16.660
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po.

03:51:16.840 --> 03:51:24.520
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Sa katunayan, hanggang ngayon, city accountant pa rin po kayo sa ilalim ng kanyang kapatid na si Mayor Sebastian Duterte. Tama po ba?

03:51:24.520 --> 03:51:25.000
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po.

03:51:25.770 --> 03:51:33.410
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: At itinalaga kayong muli ni Mayor Sebastian Duterte sa Investigating Committee ng Lungsod ng... Noong 2024. Tama po ba?

03:51:33.510 --> 03:51:34.110
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po.

03:51:34.210 --> 03:51:51.870
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Okay. Kanina din po, during your direct examination, tinanong kayo kung ano pang mga posisyon ang inyong hinawakan sa lungsod ng Davao at sinabi ninyo na humawak kayo ng job order position mula 2001 hanggang 2004. Tama po ba yung pagkakalala ko?

03:51:52.070 --> 03:52:02.700
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po.

03:52:02.700 --> 03:52:04.750
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Pero kinukumpirman nyo rin po na in 2003, nag-register Ang inyong accounting firm ng Articles of Partnership sa Securities and Exchange Commission. Tama po ba?

03:52:05.520 --> 03:52:07.280
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: May we know the relevance, Your Honor?

03:52:07.860 --> 03:52:27.760
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Again, Your Honor, this will go into the bias and interest of this witness, Your Honor. Under Section 6, Article or Rule 132 of the Rules of Court on Cross-Examination, the witness may be examined with sufficient fullness and freedom to test the accuracy and truthfulness. of the witness, as well as...

03:52:27.760 --> 03:52:31.920
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Nakumbinsin mo na, Atty. Mae. Winidraw na nga ni Atty. Lindon yung objection niya.

03:52:32.000 --> 03:52:48.700
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Thank you, Your Honor. So, just to refresh your memory, papakita ko po sa inyo ang articles of partnership ng isang Ampil, Elises, Ciudadano, and Co. CPAs.

03:53:00.340 --> 03:53:06.960
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Just to correct myself, Your Honor. The firm was not incorporated. It was registered with the SEC.

03:53:08.970 --> 03:53:15.110
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: May we be given time to produce a document before the prosecution may ask questions?

03:53:16.070 --> 03:53:25.050
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You have your assisting counsel there, counsel. You can get a copy as well so that you can look at it too for your redirect.

03:53:27.090 --> 03:53:34.270
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Again, continuing authority is given not only to assisting counsel, but to counsels rather, but also to handling counsels.

03:53:34.570 --> 03:53:54.030
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Naaalala niyo na po ba, Ms. Bahan? At kinukumpirman niyo rin po ba na noong 2003, nag-register ang inyong accounting firm sa SEC. At ang accounting firm na ito ay ang Ampil, Elises, Ciudadano & Co. CPAs. Tama po ba?

03:53:55.800 --> 03:53:58.200
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yun pong after graduation ko po.

03:53:58.520 --> 03:53:59.020
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Paki

03:53:59.020 --> 03:54:14.540
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: -sagot lang po yung tanong ko. Ang tanong ko po, Kinukumpirman niyo po ba na noong 2003, yung accounting firm niyo po nag-register sa Securities and Exchange Commission ng accounting firm? At ikaw po? Sige.

03:54:15.520 --> 03:54:16.080
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: The

03:54:16.080 --> 03:54:17.920
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: witness was answering the question, Your Honor.

03:54:18.120 --> 03:54:18.680
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Yes,

03:54:18.680 --> 03:54:20.160
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: but the question was pretty simple.

03:54:22.530 --> 03:54:29.430
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Noong 2003 ba, Ma'am Evan, kayo po ba ay nag-register ng isang accounting firm? Bahagi po ba kayo niyan?

03:54:31.270 --> 03:54:33.070
Vingeline A. Bahan: Tingnan ko po muna, Your Honor.

03:54:35.430 --> 03:54:35.930
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: And

03:55:06.840 --> 03:55:17.400
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: again, just to aid you, Ms. Bahan, pwede niyo pong tingnan yung unang pahina ng dokumentong tinitingnan niyo. Nakasaad po dyan kung kailan na rehistro ang accounting firm na inyong tinitingnan.

03:55:49.880 --> 03:55:52.920
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Attorney May, is Ms. Evan part of that firm?

03:55:53.320 --> 03:55:53.900
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Yes, Your Honor.

03:55:54.180 --> 03:55:58.880
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Is she one of the original partners of that firm?

03:55:58.900 --> 03:55:59.080
Atty. Mae Sancho Divinagracia: Yes, Your Honor.

