05:32:48.790 --> 05:32:49.470
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: nag-rewards? Rewards

05:32:49.470 --> 05:32:49.610
Vingeline A. Bahan: po sa

05:32:49.610 --> 05:32:51.310
Vingeline A. Bahan: sarili po namin

05:32:51.310 --> 05:32:58.170
Vingeline A. Bahan: po. Parang sa kabisi-bisi po ng trabaho at isa po sa bucket list ko po ang makita ko po yung Shanghai

05:32:58.170 --> 05:32:59.430
Vingeline A. Bahan: at Beijing po.

