06:26:35.990 --> 06:26:54.390
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: At ikaw ang City Accountant. At ikaw ay naging partner nung nasabing accounting firm. So, I hope you understand na kaya kami nagtatanong ng ganito dahil gusto naming malaman ang katotohanan sa mga pangyayari. Would you care to comment?

06:26:55.070 --> 06:27:01.590
Vingeline A. Bahan: Ano po, Your Honor, talaga yung... Ang relasyon po namin ni Ma'am Thelma is talagang sa trabaho lang po.

06:27:02.310 --> 06:27:25.740
Sen. Francis “Kiko” Pangilinan: Yes, and so for the record, in 2018, si Thelma Ciudadano, which the witness has already confirmed, was appointed by former President Duterte to be the Vice Chairperson of the Philippine Regulatory Commission. So, yun ang kailangan din naming

06:27:27.400 --> 06:28:05.750
