06:28:52.650 --> 06:28:57.430
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po. Based po sa OR, nag-issue po ng land bank.

06:28:57.950 --> 06:29:00.750
Sen. Imee Marcos: Yes. So the entire amount was the salary differential.

