Sen. Imee Marcos: Okay. And this amount, you said earlier, was earned by the Vice President when she was Mayor of Davao City exclusively. It did not arise from any services rendered when she assumed the office of vice president.

06:29:18.730 --> 06:29:22.410
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po. As a city mayor po siya na salary differentials

06:29:22.410 --> 06:29:22.450
Vingeline A. Bahan: po.

06:29:22.450 --> 06:29:24.850
Sen. Imee Marcos: Oo. Bilang mayor to. Strictly bilang mayor.

06:29:24.910 --> 06:29:25.530
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po.

06:29:25.710 --> 06:29:45.750
Sen. Imee Marcos: Walang additional professional or consultancy services nung naging VP na siya. Okay, so based on the city's accounting records, sa OR nga na pinakikita ninyo, was the 82,000 plus payment in satisfaction of an obligation that had already accrued as mayor.

06:29:46.150 --> 06:29:46.990
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po.

06:29:47.090 --> 06:29:49.950
