06:29:50.030 --> 06:29:50.090
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po.

06:29:50.090 --> 06:29:52.530
Sen. Imee Marcos: Utang po. In effect, parang ganon.

06:29:52.630 --> 06:29:52.830
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po.

06:29:52.830 --> 06:30:25.740
Sen. Imee Marcos: Not for additional services rendered in her new position as VP. So apart from this amount, Are there any other records or documents showing that the Vice President received salaries or consultancy fees, professional fees, any other compensation aside from the amount mentioned from the City Government of Davao for services rendered in 2023? Meron pa bang iba?

06:30:26.340 --> 06:30:27.200
Vingeline A. Bahan: Wala na po.

06:30:27.420 --> 06:30:28.120
Sen. Imee Marcos: Wala na.

06:30:28.220 --> 06:30:29.860
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yung salary differentials lang po.

06:30:29.860 --> 06:30:30.860
Sen. Imee Marcos: Yun lang talaga yun.

06:30:30.860 --> 06:30:31.220
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po.

06:30:31.260 --> 06:30:38.120
Sen. Imee Marcos: Yung 82,000 na pinag-uusapan. Wala nang dagdag doon. Wala nang iba pa sa buong records ninyo.

06:30:38.120 --> 06:30:38.360
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes

06:30:38.360 --> 06:30:41.960
Vingeline A. Bahan: po, Your Honor. Wala po. Yun lang po ang salary differentials po.

06:30:42.300 --> 06:30:52.200
Sen. Imee Marcos: Okay, yun din ang sinabi kanina ng prosecution na yun lang talaga ang nabayad ng city government bilang salary differential.

06:30:52.740 --> 06:30:53.840
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po, Your Honor.

06:30:53.980 --> 06:30:55.720
Sen. Imee Marcos: So we are very certain of that amount.

06:30:55.940 --> 06:30:56.720
Vingeline A. Bahan: Yes po, Your Honor.

06:30:56.760 --> 06:31:00.120
