06:50:13.340 --> 06:51:38.900
Atty. Sheila C. Sison: Claim to be some information given by the prosecution's witness. I presume it was NBI Director Melvin Matibag who gave this to the good senator. But since the senator mentioned that this information allegedly came from the National Bureau of Investigation and... Nothing about that information was actually presented by the prosecution at this point. That is, with your respect, Your Honor, would be something that we deem as a mere claim, Your Honor. And that's also... What we had been saying from the start, from the beginning of this trial, we have to test all evidence, all allegations through the presentation of the proper witnesses, of the proper documents. Now, if there are concerns that I understand truly and genuinely understand the concern of the good senator, then that is something perhaps that the prosecution should have dealt with during their time to present their evidence because again, Your Honor, the constitutional presumption As well as the burden of proof in this proceeding never shifts, Your Honor. Now, as to the other concern, whether we will present whoever prepared the SALN or the respondent herself, we assure the court that we will make the proper manifestation within time before this court, Your Honor.

06:51:39.140 --> 06:52:08.390
